<title>YottaFlex Payment Reconciliation</title> 
<style> 
    * { 
        margin: 0; 
        padding: 0; 
        box-sizing: border-box; 
    } 
 
    body { 
        font-family: Arial, sans-serif; 
        background-color: #f4f7fb; 
        color: #333; 
        line-height: 1.6; 
    } 
 
    header { 
        background-color: #142b4a; 
        color: white; 
        text-align: center; 
        padding: 35px 20px; 
    } 
 
    header h1 { 
        font-size: 32px; 
        margin-bottom: 10px; 
    } 
 
    nav { 
        background-color: #214d7a; 
        padding: 12px; 
        text-align: center; 
    } 
 
    nav a { 
        color: white; 
        text-decoration: none; 
        margin: 0 15px; 
        font-weight: bold; 
    } 
 
    nav a:hover { 
        color: #ffd166; 
    } 
 
    .container { 
        max-width: 1000px; 
        margin: 30px auto; 
        padding: 20px; 
    } 
 
    .hero { 
        background-color: white; 
        padding: 30px; 
        border-radius: 10px; 
        text-align: center; 
        box-shadow: 0 3px 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08); 
    } 
 
    .hero h2 { 
        color: #214d7a; 
        margin-bottom: 15px; 
    } 
 
    .button { 
        display: inline-block; 
        margin-top: 20px; 
        padding: 12px 24px; 
        background-color: #1769aa; 
        color: white; 
        text-decoration: none; 
        border-radius: 5px; 
    } 
 
    .button:hover { 
        background-color: #104c80; 
    } 
 
    .section { 
        background-color: white; 
        margin-top: 25px; 
        padding: 25px; 
        border-radius: 10px; 
        box-shadow: 0 3px 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); 
    } 
 
    .section h2 { 
        color: #214d7a; 
        margin-bottom: 15px; 
    } 
 
    .cards { 
        display: grid; 
        grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr)); 
        gap: 20px; 
        margin-top: 20px; 
    } 
 
    .card { 
        background-color: #edf4fb; 
        padding: 20px; 
        border-radius: 8px; 
        border-left: 4px solid #1769aa; 
    } 
 
    .card h3 { 
        margin-bottom: 10px; 
        color: #214d7a; 
    } 
 
    ul { 
        padding-left: 25px; 
    } 
 
    footer { 
        background-color: #142b4a; 
        color: white; 
        text-align: center; 
        padding: 20px; 
        margin-top: 35px; 
    } 
 
    @media (max-width: 600px) { 
        header h1 { 
            font-size: 25px; 
        } 
 
        nav a { 
            display: inline-block; 
            margin: 5px 8px; 
        } 
    } 
</style> 
</head> 
<body> 
<header> 
    <h1>YottaFlex</h1> 
    <p>Payment Reconciliation Synthetic Data Project</p> 
</header> 
 
<nav> 
    <a href="#home">Home</a> 
    <a href="#about">About</a> 
    <a href="#features">Features</a> 
    <a href="#workflow">Workflow</a> 
</nav> 
 
<main class="container"> 
 
    <section class="hero" id="home"> 
        <h2>Payment Reconciliation System</h2> 
        <p> 
            A deterministic synthetic-data project designed to support 
            payment reconciliation, settlement matching, and exception analysis. 
        </p> 
        <a href="#features" class="button">Explore Features</a> 
    </section> 
 
    <section class="section" id="about"> 
        <h2>About the Project</h2> 
        <p> 
            This project generates synthetic payment records and reconciles 
            payment processor settlements with bank statement records. 
            It helps demonstrate how payment discrepancies can be identified, 
            validated, and tracked. 
        </p> 
    </section> 
 
    <section class="section" id="features"> 
        <h2>Key Features</h2> 
 
        <div class="cards"> 
            <div class="card"> 
                <h3>Payment Data</h3> 
                <p>Generate synthetic merchants, payment orders, and payment attempts.</p> 
            </div> 
 
            <div class="card"> 
                <h3>Settlement Matching</h3> 
                <p>Compare settlement records against bank statement entries.</p> 
            </div> 
 
            <div class="card"> 
                <h3>Exception Detection</h3> 
                <p>Identify duplicate records, amount discrepancies, and unmatched 
transactions.</p> 
            </div> 
 
            <div class="card"> 
                <h3>Data Validation</h3> 
                <p>Check record uniqueness, relationships, totals, and dataset integrity.</p> 
            </div> 
        </div> 
    </section> 
 
    <section class="section" id="workflow"> 
        <h2>Project Workflow</h2> 
        <ul> 
            <li>Generate synthetic payment data.</li> 
            <li>Create settlement and bank statement records.</li> 
            <li>Match transactions using reconciliation rules.</li> 
            <li>Identify and record reconciliation exceptions.</li> 
            <li>Validate the generated dataset.</li> 
        </ul> 
    </section> 
</main> 
<footer> 
<p>&copy; 2026 YottaFlex Payment Reconciliation Project</p> 
<p>Developed for learning and demonstration purposes.</p> 
</footer> 
</body> 
</html> 
